Provenance note
---------------

This repository is a fork of:

    https://github.com/Jeroenvdbroek/sentinel-soc-dashboard
    Copyright (c) 2026 Jeroen van der Broek

At the time this fork was published, the upstream repository did NOT contain a
LICENSE file. The MIT terms above are applied here on the basis of the licence
the upstream author states in their own published documentation:

    "Built for enterprise SOC teams - Microsoft Sentinel - MIT License -
     Adapt freely"
        -- docs/index.html, footer

    "Built for a SOC running Microsoft Sentinel. Adapt freely."
        -- README.md

That is a clear statement of intent, but it is not a formal licence grant, and
the upstream repository's own metadata reports no licence. Anyone relying on
this for anything beyond personal use should confirm the terms with the
upstream author directly rather than depending on this file.

The second copyright line covers only the modifications made in this fork:
Azure Static Web Apps hosting with Entra ID authentication, the App Service
direct-query API, the Teams alerting Logic App, the 30-day trend queries, the
Microsoft Defender portal deep links, the security hardening, and the
screenshot tooling. It asserts no claim over the original work.
